{"id": "16-217-2-2", "zh": "以gha结尾的词根", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-218-2-4", "zh": "ghā，意思是嗅取气味。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-218-5-6", "zh": "ghāti（嗅）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-218-7-8", "zh": "ghānaṃ（鼻、嗅）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-218-9-11", "zh": "gandhaṃ ghatvā（嗅了气味之后）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-218-12-23", "zh": "这里有圣典的文句：“嗅了气味之后，正念就失去了。”", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-218-24-38", "zh": "不过，这个词根归入div等类时，就有ghāyati、ghāyitvā这些形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-219-2-5", "zh": "ghu，意思是趋近。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-219-6-8", "zh": "趋近，就是到达、证得。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-219-9-10", "zh": "ghoti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-220-2-4", "zh": "jaggha，意思是笑。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-220-5-8", "zh": "jagghati（笑）、sañjagghati（一起嬉笑）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-220-9-12", "zh": "你曾和我一起嬉笑。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-220-13-16", "zh": "就连笑也不得体。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-220-17-18", "zh": "jagghitvā（笑了之后）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-221-2-4", "zh": "taggha，意思是守护。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-221-5-6", "zh": "tagghati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-222-2-4", "zh": "sighi，意思是嗅。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-222-5-8", "zh": "嗅，就是用鼻子感受气味。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-222-9-12", "zh": "siṅghati（嗅）、upasiṅghati（凑近嗅）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-222-13-14", "zh": "upasiṅghitvā（凑近嗅了之后）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-222-15-18", "zh": "我从远处嗅那水生的花。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-222-19-28", "zh": "通晓文法的学者说，这些是“为他言”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-223-2-4", "zh": "ghu，意思是发出声音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-223-5-8", "zh": "ghoti、ghavati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-224-2-5", "zh": "raghi、laghi，意思是行进中的跨越。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-224-6-9", "zh": "gatyakkhepa，就是行进中的跨越。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-224-10-15", "zh": "raṅghati、laṅghati（跨越）、ullaṅghati（越过）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-224-16-21", "zh": "laṅghitā、ullaṅghikāpi、laṅghitvā（跨越之后）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-225-2-5", "zh": "maghi，也有欺诈的意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-225-6-9", "zh": "“ca”字是兼顾前面那个意思的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-225-10-11", "zh": "maṅghati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-226-2-5", "zh": "rāgha、lāgha，意思是有能力。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-226-6-7", "zh": "rāghati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-226-8-9", "zh": "lāghati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-227-2-5", "zh": "dāgha，也有劳累的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-227-6-8", "zh": "劳累，就是疲倦。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-227-9-12", "zh": "“ca”字是兼顾“有能力”这个意思的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-227-13-14", "zh": "dāghati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-227-15-16", "zh": "nidāgha（炎热、夏季）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-228-2-4", "zh": "silāgha，意思是赞扬。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-228-5-7", "zh": "赞扬，就是称赞。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-228-8-9", "zh": "silāghati（称赞）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-228-10-11", "zh": "silāghā（称赞）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-228-12-14", "zh": "他称赞佛陀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-228-15-16", "zh": "silāghitvā（称赞之后）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-228-17-25", "zh": "通晓文法的学者说，这是“为自言”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-229-2-4", "zh": "以上是以gha结尾的词根的各种形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-230-2-6", "zh": "以上是bhū等类中以k组辅音结尾的词根的各种形式", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-231-2-3", "zh": "到此结束。", "confidence": 85}
